flowchart TD
  R[Request] --> P{Safe deterministic greeting shortcut?}
  P -->|Yes| A[Brief reply, no task]
  P -->|No| L[Small LLM typed intent decision]
  L --> V[Schema and trusted policy validation]
  V --> C{Provider/tool capability and confidence adequate?}
  C -->|No| S[Escalate to approved stronger model or ask focused question]
  C -->|Yes| D[SCS search and select]
  S --> D
  D --> E[Capability-specific state controller]
  E --> Q[Evidence review and concise delivery]
